  {
   "name": "RealizarTransferencia",
   "description": "Transfers an amount between two active accounts. It trims the account numbers and rejects equal accounts. It validates origin (exists, active) and destination (exists, active), calculates the commission (flat 0.50 up to 1000.00, otherwise 0.1% rounded half away from zero, cap 5.00, then +1.00 for type INM) and checks that the balance covers amount plus commission. It then debits the origin by amount plus commission, credits the destination by the amount, records the transfer with the next number and commits everything in one transaction.",
